# udap:meta cloud=aws region=us-east-1 target=ec2

developer: Developer / You { shape: person; udap-type: generic.user }
github: GitHub Repository { shape: rectangle; udap-type: generic.app }
pipeline: GitHub Actions Pipeline { shape: rectangle; udap-type: generic.app }
state_bucket: Terraform State (S3) { shape: cylinder; udap-type: aws.s3 }
modules_repo: Enterprise Modules Repo (GitHub) { shape: rectangle; udap-type: generic.app }
vpc: AWS Default VPC {
  ec2: EC2 Instance(s) { udap-type: aws.ec2 }
  sg: Security Group { udap-type: generic.app }
}

developer -> github: push resource request
github -> pipeline: triggers deploy workflow
pipeline -> state_bucket: read + write terraform state
pipeline -> modules_repo: source reusable modules
modules_repo -> vpc.ec2: provisions via terraform apply
pipeline -> vpc.sg: enforces security rules
pipeline -> vpc.ec2: verify provisioned resource
